{"title":"Career roadmap · MERN Developer","role":"MERN Developer","summary":"Career alignment:\nA MERN Developer builds full-stack web applications using MongoDB, Express.js, React.js and Node.js. A BCA with Full Stack Development is a direct pathway, but employability depends heavily on programming fundamentals, JavaScript/TypeScript, React, backend development, databases, APIs, testing, deployment and a strong project portfolio.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Full Stack Developer Intern, React Developer Intern, Junior Web Developer"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Junior MERN Developer, Full Stack Developer, React Developer, Node.js Developer"}],[{"text":"3–5 years"},{"text":"Full Stack Engineer, Senior MERN Developer, Software Engineer"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Full Stack Engineer, Technical Lead, Software Engineer II/III"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Staff Engineer, Engineering Manager, Solutions Architect, Principal Engineer"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BCA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Programming + Web Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals before jumping into frameworks."},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JavaScript fundamentals"},{"text":"Variables, functions, arrays, objects"},{"text":"Scope, closures and callbacks"},{"text":"ES6+ syntax"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"OOP concepts"},{"text":"Asynchronous programming"},{"text":"Promises and async/await"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Web"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML5"},{"text":"CSS3"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Flexbox"},{"text":"CSS Grid"},{"text":"JavaScript DOM"},{"text":"Browser APIs"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"GitHub"},{"text":"VS Code"},{"text":"Chrome DevTools"},{"text":"npm"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Responsive portfolio website"},{"text":"Landing page"},{"text":"JavaScript expense tracker"},{"text":"Weather application using an API"},{"text":"To-do/productivity application"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — React + Backend Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Frontend"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"React"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Props/state"},{"text":"Hooks"},{"text":"Context API"},{"text":"React Router"},{"text":"Forms and validation"},{"text":"API integration"},{"text":"State management"},{"text":"Performance optimisation"},{"text":"Reusable components"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn TypeScript alongside JavaScript once the fundamentals are comfortable."},{"type":"h","text":"Backend"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Node.js"},{"text":"Express.js"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"Middleware"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"},{"text":"JWT"},{"text":"Sessions/cookies"},{"text":"Input validation"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"API security"},{"text":"File uploads"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MongoDB"},{"text":"MongoDB Atlas"},{"text":"CRUD operations"},{"text":"Schema design"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Aggregation"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Data modelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn SQL even though MERN uses MongoDB."},{"type":"h","text":"Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — E-commerce application"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Product catalogue"},{"text":"Search/filter"},{"text":"Cart"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Admin dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Social/community platform"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User profiles"},{"text":"